OL,3,AUganda pulling out of Prince Harry's
OL,4,AInvictus Games, says military chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FUgandan government spokesman Alan
OL,7,FKasujja confirmed this to the BBC:
OL,8,F"General Kainerugaba decides whether or
OL,9,Fnot the UPDF [Uganda People's Defence
OL,10,FForce] participates in the Invictus
OL,11,FGames. What you saw is his stated
OL,12,Fposition. If it changes, he will let
OL,13,Fthe world know."
